struct FLoadingNarrativeV82 {const TCHAR* Key;const TCHAR* En;const TCHAR* Zh;};
static const FLoadingNarrativeV82 LoadingNarrativesV82[]={
    {TEXT("uk.arras"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen\n\nMen wait in the tunnels beneath the town for the guns to lift. Sleet strikes the chalk slopes. The attack goes east to hold the German forces here ahead of the coming French offensive.\n\nAmmunition parties go up the chalk road; stretchers come down it. Machine guns answer beyond the crest. The NCO reads out the sections again, but the guns drown the reply from the leading infantry in front.\n\nArras and the French attack on the Aisne formed parts of the spring offensive plan."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日\n\n城下的坑道里，士兵等着炮火转向远处。雨雪打在白垩坡上。进攻向东展开，牵制当面的德军，接应即将到来的法军攻势。\n\n携弹队沿白垩路上行，担架从同一条路下来。坡脊之后传来机枪声，军士把各班的名字再念一遍，前队的回答被炮声盖住。\n\n阿拉斯攻势与法军埃纳河攻势同属春季作战计划。")},
    {TEXT("uk.roeux1917"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen\n\nA machine gun fires through a gap in the factory wall. Fragments strike below the railway bank. The roof has gone, but the underground shelters remain connected. Bombers halt at a traverse and pass grenades forward by hand.\n\nRiflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works.\n\nThe Arras offensive continued until sixteen May."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日\n\n厂墙缺口里有机枪开火，弹屑打在铁路堤下。炮击揭开了屋顶，地下掩体却还通着。投弹兵在壕角停下，把手榴弹逐个递向前队。\n\n步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。\n\n阿拉斯攻势延续至五月十六日。")},
    {TEXT("uk.bullecourt1917"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bullecourt · Three May nineteen seventeen\n\nWreckage from April lies in the wire. Another assault party reaches the gap. A muzzle appears over the chalk parapet; the dugout exits are open. Rifle grenades fall towards the traverse while the leading men cross the obstacles.\n\nA bearer's box catches on a strand behind them. The next man lies down to free it. Firing rises and falls on the neighbouring sector. From a shell hole, the NCO searches for the section that has just gone forward.\n\nAustralian and British troops attacked Bullecourt again in May."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 布勒库尔 · 一九一七年五月三日\n\n铁丝间留着四月战斗的残骸，新的进攻队又来到缺口前。白垩壕肩后冒出枪口，掩蔽部的出口还通着，投弹兵把枪榴弹送向壕角。\n\n前队已经越过障碍，携弹手的箱子却挂住了断丝。后面的人伏下帮他松开，邻段的射击忽近忽远。军士从弹坑里探头，寻找刚才出发的那一班。\n\n澳大利亚与英国部队于五月再攻布勒库尔。")},
    {TEXT("uk.messines"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen\n\nThe ground rises and the old ridge trenches vanish into dust. Plumer's Second Army advances; Australian and New Zealand troops move on the adjoining sectors. The NCO follows the fresh crater lip, looking for a passage onto the heights.\n\nThe gun crew drags its mounting over loose earth. A bearer tests each step for firm ground. The landmarks on the sketch have gone. Behind them, the stretcher party waits for word of a gap that will carry a loaded stretcher.\n\nUnderground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日\n\n地面猛然抬起，山脊的旧壕道没入烟尘。普卢默的第二集团军向前推进，澳新部队在邻段出发。军士循着刚露出的坑岸，寻找通往高处的路。\n\n枪组把枪架拖过松土，携弹手试着踩出一条硬路。原先标定的地形已经改变，担架队在后面停住，等前队报回尚能通行的缺口。\n\n梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。")},
    {TEXT("uk.messines_counter1917"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Nine June nineteen seventeen\n\nA corner is missing from the new parapet. The gun already faces the eastern slope. Two days have passed since the attack, and spades are still at work. Reliefs follow the crater path and ask which trench remains open.\n\nReserves gather behind the crest. Bearers edge past the wounded with their ammunition. German parties move below the opposite slope. The NCO watches through the fresh sandbags; the floor still bears the marks of the former gun mounting.\n\nBritish forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月九日\n\n新胸墙还缺着一角，枪组已把枪口转向东坡。进攻过去两日，阵地上的铁锹没有停过。换防队循弹坑间的小路上来，先问哪一道壕沟还能走。\n\n预备队在脊后集合，携弹手从伤员身旁挤过。德军在对面坡下活动，军士伏在新垒的土袋间观察。壕底还有旧枪架留下的凹痕。\n\n梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。")},
    {TEXT("uk.ypres"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen\n\nThe duckboards end in standing water. The leading men stop on the last plank. Shellfire has broken the drains outside the town and joined the craters into pools. A German gun opens beyond them; fresh mud splashes onto the surface.\n\nThe mortar crew brings its equipment forward. Field guns are caught on the road behind. Bearers lift their boxes above the water, passing wounded men seated beside the path. The NCO tests the ground before the next man steps off.\n\nThe Third Battle of Ypres began on thirty-one July."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日\n\n木板路在积水中断开，前队停在最后一块木板上。城外的排水沟已经被炮火打坏，弹坑连成水面。远处德军枪位开火，水上浮着新溅起的泥。\n\n壕炮组带着器材赶来，野炮还堵在后面的路上。携弹手把箱子举过水面，伤员坐在路边等待。军士试过脚下的硬地，才让下一人跨出。\n\n第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。")},
    {TEXT("uk.langemarck1917"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · Sixteen August nineteen seventeen\n\nOne wall remains of the farmhouse. A concrete shelter behind it is still firing. Men approach across the wet field; helmets on the next sector appear and disappear beyond the pools. The observer lies on broken bricks, searching for the loophole.\n\nMortar ammunition arrives from the rear, box after box. The firm track to the farm is narrow. A stretcher party has stopped beside it. The NCO raises a hand over the wall for riflemen who have lost contact.\n\nThe Ypres offensive failed to achieve its intended breakthrough."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月十六日\n\n农舍只剩一面墙，墙后的混凝土掩体仍在射击。前队沿湿田接近，邻队的钢盔隔着积水时隐时现。观察员伏在碎砖上，辨认射孔的位置。\n\n迫击炮弹由后方传来，一箱接着一箱。通往农场的硬路很窄，担架队已在路边停下。军士把手举过残墙，让失去联系的步枪手看见。\n\n伊普尔攻势直到秋季仍未取得预期突破。")},
    {TEXT("uk.menin1917"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · Twenty September nineteen seventeen\n\nFresh earth falls between the stumps as the barrage moves deeper into the wood. The leading men cross a low ridge and lose sight of the next section. The gun crew sets its mounting among the exposed roots.\n\nBearers bring spades with the ammunition. There has been little time to deepen the captured position. German posts fire from behind broken timber. More men arrive along the crowded track. A rifleman pushes dead branches aside and points his muzzle towards the tree line.\n\nThe Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月二十日\n\n树桩之间落着刚翻起的土，炮火正向林地深处移动。前队越过一道浅脊，邻班便从视野中消失。枪组停下来，把枪架放在残根之间。\n\n携弹队还带着铁锹，新占的地段来不及挖深。德军哨位在断木后射击，后面的道路又有增援上来。步枪手把枯枝拨开，枪口朝着林缘。\n\n梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。")},
    {TEXT("uk.cambrai"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · Twenty November nineteen seventeen\n\nTracks bite into firm ground and wire falls before the tanks. Infantry follow a Mark IV to the trench, but a bend below is still firing. The guns drown the engine. The leading tank has crossed another obstacle.\n\nRiflemen lie in the track marks while bombers approach a dugout. Bearers enter through the gap with their boxes. Men already across point out the deep trench and direct them around it. The tank disappears behind the next rise.\n\nBritain massed tanks against the Hindenburg Line at Cambrai."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 一九一七年十一月二十日\n\n履带压进坚实田地，铁丝在战车前面倒下。步兵跟着Mark IV来到壕边，壕底的转角却还在射击。炮声盖过发动机，前车已越过下一道障碍。\n\n步枪手伏在履带留下的沟里，投弹兵向掩蔽部接近。携弹队从缺口进入，先来的人员指着深壕让他们绕行。战车的背影逐渐被坡脊遮住。\n\n英军在康布雷集中使用坦克突破兴登堡防线。")},
    {TEXT("uk.bourlon1917"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nThe gun at the woodland exit changes direction. Its belt crosses newly stacked sandbags. German counterattacks are closing in while reliefs and ammunition parties still enter the wood. Wounded men meet them at the junction.\n\nRifle fire comes from behind broken trees. A hollow conceals the flank. The NCO guides returning men into the communication trench, then lets the carrying party through. A stretcher handle scrapes wet earth from the wall; the bearers turn it carefully at the bend.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n林口的机枪转了方向，弹带横过刚堆好的土袋。德军反击正在逼近，换防人员和携弹队还往林中走。撤下来的伤员在路口迎面遇见他们。\n\n断树后传来步枪声，浅洼遮住侧翼的动静。军士把返回的人引进交通壕，再让前送的队伍通过。担架的木柄擦过壕壁，刮下一层湿土。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。")},
    {TEXT("uk.winter_raid1918"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen\n\nThe post gives no answer. The duty NCO listens again. Footprints mark the low ground before the wire; scattered shots come from the German line. A light patrol enters the wet ditch, and the man behind covers the lamp.\n\nWire is broken between the outpost and headquarters. No runner has returned. Sentries watch the mouth of the ditch while the relief waits in the trench. Something stirs in the water. A gunner rests his hand beside the trigger.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月\n\n哨位没有回答，值更军士又听了一会儿。铁丝前的低地留着脚印，零星枪声从德军阵地方向传来。轻装巡逻队走进湿沟，后面的人掩住灯光。\n\n前哨与连部之间有几段断线，尚无人带回消息。留守的哨兵望着沟口，换防队已在壕内等候。泥水里响了一下，枪手把手放到扳机旁。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。")},
    {TEXT("uk.michael"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen\n\nFifth Army men coming back crowd the junction. Some support wounded comrades; others ask for their NCO. Shellfire has cut the telephone wire. The posts in the fog give no answer, and German parties are passing between the strongpoints.\n\nThe rearguard gun waits beside the road for the last scattered men. A bearer leaves his ammunition at the position and takes a stretcher handle. The NCO counts those beside him, then looks into the fog again. Firing comes from farther behind.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日\n\n路口挤满第五集团军撤下来的人员，有人扶着伤员，有人找自己的军士。炮火打断了电话线，浓雾中的前哨已无回音。德军从支点之间穿过，枪声移向后方。\n\n后卫枪组守在道路旁，等最后一批失散人员经过。携弹手把箱子留在枪位，转身接过一副担架。军士查完眼前的人数，又向雾里望去。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。")},
    {TEXT("uk.lys1918"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen\n\nA runner brings word of a breach on the neighbouring sector. The telephone is silent. Ditches divide the fields, carrying the sound of machine guns across the water. Riflemen leave their old position to join scattered sentries at the junction.\n\nTroops gather beside the crossing. The carrying party needs that road too. The NCO checks the posts against his map and leaves a runner beside the track. Guns still fire across the bank. Several marked positions have sent no report.\n\nGermany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日\n\n联络兵带来邻段失守的消息，电话里却无人回答。河沟把田野分成窄块，机枪声沿水面传来。侧翼的步枪手离开旧枪位，向路口的零散哨兵靠拢。\n\n渡口旁有队伍重新集合，携弹队也要从这里经过。军士用地图核对前哨，把一名传令兵留在路边。对岸的枪还在响，名册上几个阵位没有回报。\n\n德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。")},
    {TEXT("uk.villers1918"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen\n\nTracks sound beyond the orchard. German troops hold the village junction. A British tank turns beside a broken wall and infantry follow the ditch. Its crew cannot see behind the masonry, where firing comes from a lane.\n\nThe road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins.\n\nThe first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日\n\n果园外传来履带声，村里的路口已经被德军占据。英军战车从残墙旁转出，步兵贴着沟边跟上。车组看不见墙后的动静，枪声却从巷口传来。\n\n通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。\n\n这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。")},
    {TEXT("uk.amiens"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · Eight August nineteen eighteen\n\nLow mist hides the village boundary. A tank passes the leading infantry. Australian and Canadian troops are moving forward as the barrage lifts into the distance. Riflemen cross the field bank and search through the mist for the next party.\n\nA runner leaves a man at the fork to guide the bearers following the tracks. Isolated posts still resist. Men ahead stop and lie down when shots reach them. Engine noise fades until only a tank's roof shows above the mist.\n\nLudendorff called it the German Army's black day."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 一九一八年八月八日\n\n低雾遮住村界，战车从前队身旁驶过。澳大利亚与加拿大部队已经出发，炮火向远处延伸。步枪手越过田埂，隔着雾寻找相邻队伍的身影。\n\n传令兵在岔路留下指路的人，携弹队沿车辙跟来。孤立枪位还在抵抗，前面时而有人停下卧倒。发动机的声音渐远，一辆战车只剩露出雾面的车顶。\n\n鲁登道夫称这一天为德国陆军的黑暗之日。")},
    {TEXT("uk.scarpe1918"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Scarpe · Twenty-six August nineteen eighteen\n\nA sapper crouches beside the old wire. A shell newly exposed by the bombardment lies half buried. Canadian troops pass the forward positions while German rearguards fire from the village edge. Fresh craters overlap the older ones in the chalk.\n\nBearers wait at the gap. The leading men follow the passage the engineers have marked. Riflemen lie along a field boundary as a stretcher passes behind them. The NCO stops a man taking a shortcut and points to the exposed shell.\n\nAllied attacks drove the Germans back during the Hundred Days."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 斯卡尔普 · 一九一八年八月二十六日\n\n工兵在旧铁丝旁蹲下，刚翻出的炮弹还半埋在土里。加拿大部队从前方阵位经过，村边德军后卫继续射击。白垩田地上，新弹坑叠着旧弹坑。\n\n携弹队等在障碍缺口，前队沿工兵标出的通路向前。步枪手在田界卧倒，担架从他们身后送回。军士拦住一名抄近路的士兵，指向那枚露出的弹体。\n\n协约国在百日攻势中持续迫使德军后撤。")},
    {TEXT("uk.hindenburg"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen\n\nSmoke rises along the canal. Shellfire cuts earth from the steep bank. A bridge still reaches the far side. Forty-sixth Division infantry watch the guns above from the towpath. Sappers descend the broken slope with their equipment while men behind hold a rope.\n\nFew can pass down the narrow approach at once. Bearers hand their boxes from man to man. Firing crosses the water. The leading men wait against the bank, and the NCO looks up towards the bridge still standing above them.\n\nBritish troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on twenty-nine September."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日\n\n运河两岸升起烟，陡坡上的土被炮火削落。桥还连着对岸，第四十六师的步兵从纤道上观察高处的枪位。工兵带着器材沿破坡下去，后面的人拉住绳索。\n\n下坡路只能容少数人通过，携弹队把箱子逐个传下。水面响起射击声，前队伏在岸边等候。军士挤到转弯处，抬头看了一眼那座尚完整的桥。\n\n英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。")},
    {TEXT("uk.selle"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · Seventeen October nineteen eighteen\n\nGunfire comes from the railway cutting. The train is still covering the evacuation. Rain runs down the embankment as engineers approach the rails along its foot. Infantry spread to either side; the anti-armour crew searches for a view of the carriage.\n\nAmmunition vehicles and stretchers crowd the road into the valley. An observer climbs higher and reports the train's guns. The crew moves a sleeper out of its way. Beyond the cutting, the visible wheels have not yet begun to turn.\n\nThe Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月十七日\n\n铁路切口里传出炮声，列车还在掩护后方撤运。雨水顺路堤流下，工兵贴着坡脚接近铁轨。步兵在两侧展开，反装甲枪组寻找能看见车体的位置。\n\n公路上挤着运弹车辆和担架，河谷入口越来越窄。观察员爬到高处，把列车的枪位报回。枪组搬开挡在脚边的枕木，远处的车轮仍未转动。\n\n塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。")},
    {TEXT("uk.valenciennes1918"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November nineteen eighteen\n\nA handcart stands beside the road, its bundles tied with string. Canadian troops are approaching the town, where civilians remain in the streets. An observer lies at the orchard edge, studying a muzzle between the broken walls.\n\nA stretcher party passes the military vehicles. Riflemen follow a shallow ditch towards the exit. The batteries wait for a position from the forward posts. The NCO keeps the following men under the wall. A door opens farther down the street, and the observer turns his glasses.\n\nCanadian troops took Valenciennes in early November."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 一九一八年十一月初\n\n手推车停在路边，车上的包袱用绳子扎着。加拿大部队正在接近城市，居民还没有离开全部街区。观察员伏在果园边，仔细辨认残墙之间的枪口。\n\n担架队从军车旁走过，步枪手沿浅沟靠近出口。炮兵等着前沿报回位置，军士让后队暂留墙下。街道深处开了一扇门，观察员把望远镜转了过去。\n\n加拿大部队于十一月初攻占瓦朗谢讷。")},
    {TEXT("uk.sambre"),TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen\n\nThe day's orders reach headquarters. Sappers carry their tools towards the canal. News of armistices elsewhere has arrived, but the German posts ahead are still firing. A cart of household goods passes along the road through the outskirts.\n\nRiflemen approach the crossing. The NCO keeps the stretcher party beside a wall while the following troops wait for a report. A bearer presses his ammunition lid shut. A muzzle flashes across the canal, and the runner lies down again beside the ditch.\n\nThe Western Front armistice took effect at eleven on eleven November."),TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日\n\n当天的作战命令仍送到了连部，工兵带着工具走向运河。别处停战的消息已经传来，眼前的德军哨位却还在射击。城郊道路上有人推着家当经过。\n\n步枪手沿渡口接近，军士让担架队留在墙边。后续部队等着前面的回报，携弹手把箱盖重新压紧。运河对岸冒出枪口的火光，传令兵又伏了下去。\n\n十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。")},
    {TEXT("de.arras"),TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen\n\nThe outpost telephone gives only static. Sleet hides the chalk slope and British troops have crossed the damaged forward line. Men come out of the caves with their rifles. The gun posts report that ammunition is running short.\n\nCounterattack parties assemble beside the chalk road. A runner follows the broken wire while the guns beyond the crest keep firing. Bearers carry their boxes past stretchers. Several silent posts have yet to return their rolls.\n\nArras and the French attack on the Aisne formed parts of the spring offensive plan."),TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日\n\n前哨的电话只有杂音。雨雪遮住白垩坡，英军已越过被炮击打断的前沿。洞穴里的士兵重新携枪出壕，枪位向连部报来缺弹。\n\n反击队在白垩路旁集合。联络兵循断线找去，坡后的机枪继续射击。携弹手把箱子搬过担架，几个失联哨位尚未报回点名结果。\n\n阿拉斯攻势与法军埃纳河攻势同属春季作战计划。")},
    {TEXT("de.roeux1917"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April nineteen seventeen\n\nBricks cover the dugout exit. Reliefs bend low to come out. British troops are approaching the chemical works, and a gunner watches the trench mouth through a broken wall. The linesman finds only a severed end among the factory ruins.\n\nCounterattack parties assemble below the railway bank. Bearers hand boxes to a gun still firing. The NCO points to the communication trench cut by shellfire and directs men along another passage. Footsteps sound close on the other side of the wall.\n\nThe Arras offensive continued until sixteen May."),TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月中旬\n\n地下掩体的出口落满碎砖，换防人员弯腰钻出。化工厂外已有英军接近，枪手隔着断墙观察壕口。电话线穿过厂房废墟，接线兵只找到一截断头。\n\n反击队沿铁路堤下集合，携弹兵把箱子交给仍在射击的枪组。军士指着被炮火切断的交通壕，重新安排去路。厂墙另一面的脚步听得很近。\n\n阿拉斯攻势延续至五月十六日。")},
    {TEXT("de.bullecourt1917"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · Three May nineteen seventeen\n\nThe order to man the trench reaches the dugout as rifle grenades burst outside the parapet. April's wreckage still weighs down the wire. British and Australian infantry approach its gaps again. The crew pulls a belt beside the mounting.\n\nBearers follow the deep trench while reliefs halt at a traverse. Smoke hides the neighbouring post. The NCO sends a runner to find it. A helmet appears above the slope and disappears; the gunner turns his mounting to search the ground again.\n\nAustralian and British troops attacked Bullecourt again in May."),TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 一九一七年五月三日\n\n掩蔽部里响起上壕的口令，枪榴弹正在胸墙外爆炸。铁丝之间还压着四月留下的残骸，英澳步兵又从缺口接近。枪组把弹带拖到射位旁边。\n\n携弹兵贴着深壕前送，换防队在转角停步。相邻哨位只见烟尘，军士让一名联络兵过去查看。坡面上露出钢盔又消失，枪手转动枪架追着看。\n\n澳大利亚与英国部队于五月再攻布勒库尔。")},
    {TEXT("de.messines"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen\n\nEarth has buried the old trench entrance. The tree marked in the report has disappeared. British shellfire passes over the ridge after the underground explosions. A surviving gun fires across a fresh crater; the runner climbs its lip and drops down.\n\nArriving riflemen gather scattered men along the broken slope. Bearers try to reach the collapsed trench. A new British muzzle appears opposite. The NCO folds his map again. The communication trench he needs lies beyond the steep new bank.\n\nUnderground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened."),TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日\n\n旧壕入口被土埋住，报告里标出的树也找不到了。地下爆炸过后，英军炮火越过山脊。幸存枪位隔着新坑射击，联络兵爬上坑岸再伏下来。\n\n前来的步枪手沿碎土收拢人员，携弹兵试着下到塌壕里。对面出现新的英军枪口，军士把地图折回原处。他要找的交通壕已在陡壁另一面。\n\n梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。")},
    {TEXT("de.messines_counter1917"),TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · Nine June nineteen seventeen\n\nThe NCO points from the assembly place towards a crater lip. The new approach turns there. British troops strengthen the ridge parapet above German trenches cut by explosions. Riflemen climb in turn to locate the surviving posts.\n\nBearers arrive up the eastern slope with loose earth on their boots. The gun crew waits at the end of the narrow path. Its runner has not returned. The counterattack party lies along the bank, watching men move freshly filled sandbags on the opposite side.\n\nBritish forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."),TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 一九一七年六月九日\n\n集合处的军士指着坑岸，新接近路从那里转过去。山脊上的英军正在加固胸墙，旧德军壕道已被爆破切断。步枪手轮流爬高，辨认幸存哨位的方向。\n\n携弹队从东坡赶来，鞋上带着松土。枪组在狭路尽头等候，前面的联络兵尚未回来。反击队沿坡伏下，能看见对面有人搬动新装满的土袋。\n\n梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。")},
    {TEXT("de.ypres"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen\n\nA bearer stops at a sunken plank. His box must pass from hand to hand. Water separates the forward guns as British troops approach through rain and smoke. The mortar crew waits for ammunition. Its lookout keeps wiping the glass.\n\nA firm track passes behind the crater bank. Reliefs crouch beside it while the NCO sends a messenger ahead. He turns towards the distant firing again. The next machine gun can still be heard, but the men behind have found no path to it.\n\nThe Third Battle of Ypres began on thirty-one July."),TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日\n\n携弹兵停在陷下去的木板前，箱子只能从手上传过去。前沿各枪位被水隔开，英军在雨烟中接近。壕炮组等着炮弹，守望的人不断擦去镜片上的水。\n\n一条硬路从坑岸后通过，换防队蹲在路边等候。军士让送信的人先走，又向远处枪声张望。邻近的机枪还在响，后方却没有找到过去的路。\n\n第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。")},
    {TEXT("de.langemarck1917"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August nineteen seventeen\n\nDust falls from the concrete roof. The gunner returns his eye to the loophole. Water covers the field outside the farm, and British troops follow the dry approaches. Reliefs squeeze past ammunition boxes on the track beside the shelter.\n\nMortar bombs fall behind the ruined wall. A runner cannot hear the next post's reply. The NCO leaves the crew watching the entrance and follows the wall to its corner. Reflections move on the water, but footsteps on the dry track have stopped.\n\nThe Ypres offensive failed to achieve its intended breakthrough."),TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月\n\n混凝土顶上落下灰尘，枪手把眼睛贴回射孔。农场外的田野已经积水，英军沿干路接近。送弹路经过掩体旁，换防人员侧身从弹箱之间穿过。\n\n迫击炮弹落在残墙后面，联络兵听不清邻哨的回答。军士让枪组继续守着入口，自己沿墙走到拐角。水面晃着几个倒影，干路上的脚步却停了。\n\n伊普尔攻势直到秋季仍未取得预期突破。")},
    {TEXT("de.menin1917"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September nineteen seventeen\n\nThe observer opens his sketch and shifts a forward mark farther into the wood. British shellfire continues to lift. New parapets appear among the stumps. Reserves enter along a broken path; the gun crew stops for news from the flank.\n\nSurviving posts lie between the forces. A bearer is unsure which trench mouth to take. The NCO signals beyond a shattered tree, and the leading men cross the open patch one at a time. The observer's pencil rests on his fresh line.\n\nThe Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."),TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月\n\n观察员摊开图纸，把前沿标记向林后移了一点。英军炮火还在延伸，新胸墙已出现在树桩之间。预备队沿破路进入林地，枪组停下来等候侧翼消息。\n\n幸存哨位夹在两军之间，携弹兵不知道该在哪个壕口转弯。军士向断树后打出手势，前队逐人穿过开阔处。观察员的铅笔仍压在那条刚画出的线上。\n\n梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。")},
    {TEXT("de.cambrai"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nThe counterattack order reaches the gun post. Tanks from the earlier fighting lie in the fields. British troops are repairing their new parapets. Our batteries fire on the approaches while the riflemen wait for the MG 08/15 crews to pack their belts.\n\nA bend in the communication trench hides the next loophole. Bearers stand aside at the junction and stretchers pass back along the route. Captured vehicles have not left the repair yard; the crew carries its gun up the slope on their shoulders.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the ground gained by the British at Cambrai."),TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n反击命令送到枪位。田野里散着上次进攻留下的战车，英军正在修补新胸墙。炮兵向接近线开火，步枪手等待 MG 08/15 枪组收好弹带。\n\n交通壕转过一处路口，前面的射孔便看不见了。携弹队在壕角让出通路，担架沿原路回送。修理场里的缴获车辆还未归队，枪手先用两肩把机枪送上坡。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。")},
    {TEXT("de.bourlon1917"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen\n\nMen in the hollow lower their muzzles as another burst comes from the tree line. British guns face the road, where wounded men are still leaving the salient. The counterattack follows a damaged trench with bearers behind the last rifleman.\n\nBroken trees hide the next party. An artillery runner stops at the trench mouth to check his position. Vehicles move against the returning traffic on the road. The NCO lies beside the ditch and stops a rifleman about to cross the gap.\n\nThe German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."),TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日\n\n浅洼里的人压低枪口，前面林缘又响起一阵机枪声。英军把枪位转向道路，突出部的伤员还在往外送。反击队沿受损壕沟接近，携弹兵跟着最后一人。\n\n断树把邻队遮住，炮兵联络兵在壕口停下来核对位置。道路上有车辆逆着退回的人流前行。军士伏到沟边，伸手拦住准备穿过缺口的步枪手。\n\n德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。")},
    {TEXT("de.winter_raid1918"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen\n\nFresh tracks mark the snow beside the trench, but the outpost gives no answer. The linesman collects a broken end and searches along the wet ditch. A light party fastens its loose equipment before leaving the parapet after dark.\n\nThe remaining gun crew hears scattered shots. Reliefs have reached the rear trench. The patrol leaves a man at the bend and vanishes beyond the wire. The duty NCO waits against the wall, with the silent telephone receiver still held beside his ear.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."),TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月\n\n壕边的雪里有新脚印，前哨却没有回话。接线兵收起断头，顺着湿沟查找另一段线。轻装队把松动的器材系紧，等天色暗下来再离开胸墙。\n\n留守的枪组听见远处零星射击，换防队已经到达后壕。巡逻队在拐角留下一个人，前队消失在铁丝后面。军士靠着壕壁等候，手里的电话没有响。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。")},
    {TEXT("de.michael"),TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen\n\nThe leading riflemen cross a broken trench. Only the nearest men show in the fog. Gaps open between British Fifth Army strongpoints while the barrage moves farther back. The gun crew follows with its equipment; bearers search for a path through the old wire.\n\nThe road is close ahead, but the flank has sent no position. A runner opens his map at the trench mouth. The NCO points back along their lengthening route. A loose rope on an ammunition box needs tying again.\n\nGermany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March."),TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日\n\n先遣步枪手越过破壕，雾里只看得见最近的人。英军第五集团军的支点之间有缺口，炮火继续向后延伸。枪组抬着器材跟上，携弹队还在寻找穿过旧铁丝的路。\n\n前队已经接近公路，侧翼却没有报回位置。联络兵在壕口摊开地图，军士向他指了指身后的长路。弹箱上的绳子磨松了，携弹手停下重新打结。\n\n三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。")},
    {TEXT("de.lys1918"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen\n\nThe mounting sinks into soft ground. Bearers behind the crew help lift it. The leading men have crossed the ditch towards a gap between Portuguese and British positions. A British post still fires from the junction, forcing both banks down.\n\nThe NCO follows firmer ground in search of the next party. A runner returns through another ditch. Supplies remain at the crossing. The crew carries its remaining boxes onto the bank, watching a small hand signal from the men across the water.\n\nGermany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."),TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日\n\n枪架在软土里陷下去，后面的携弹兵赶来帮忙。前队已经越过河沟，向葡英阵位之间的缺口前进。路口还有英军哨位射击，水沟两侧的人都伏下来。\n\n军士沿较硬的地面寻找邻队，传令兵从另一条沟里回来。后方的补给尚在渡口，枪组只能先把现有弹箱搬上岸。前队的手势隔着水面显得很小。\n\n德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。")},
    {TEXT("de.villers1918"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen\n\nA tank turns at the village entrance and infantry pass the orchard beside its flank. British armour fires from the outskirts. Rifles answer behind a broken wall. The crew cannot see the lane, where the leading men wait for those behind.\n\nBearers arrive along the village road. The NCO sends a section into a side alley. Tracks can be heard beyond the buildings, but the vehicle is hidden. A burst comes from a doorway and the first rifleman presses against the bricks.\n\nThe first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here."),TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日\n\n村口的战车转向路口，步兵借着车侧经过果园。英军装甲在近郊开火，断墙后也有步枪声。车组看不见小巷，前队停在墙角，等后面的人靠近。\n\n携弹兵沿村道赶来，军士让一班步枪手进入侧巷。履带声绕过建筑又传回来，车影已经被挡住。门洞里一阵射击，走在最前面的人立刻贴住砖墙。\n\n这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。")},
    {TEXT("de.amiens"),TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · Eight August nineteen eighteen\n\nThe report names tanks, but its runner cannot place the neighbouring unit. Engines sound across the misty fields. Returning troops crowd the junction. The anti-tank crew lowers its equipment and searches for a position facing the approach.\n\nA machine gun covers men leaving isolated posts while reinforcements pass the other way. The NCO calls bearers under the ruined wall and asks each about the front. One soldier covered in mud points into the mist. His arm stays raised as more men pass.\n\nLudendorff called it the German Army's black day."),TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 一九一八年八月八日\n\n前哨的报告上写着战车，送信的人却说不清邻队在哪里。雾中的田野传来发动机声，路口挤满返回部队。反坦克枪组把器材放下，朝来路寻找射位。\n\n机枪掩护孤立阵位撤出的人，增援在另一侧逆向通过。军士把携弹手叫到残墙下，逐个问前面的情况。一名满身泥土的士兵指向雾里，手仍没有放下。\n\n鲁登道夫称这一天为德国陆军的黑暗之日。")},
    {TEXT("de.scarpe1918"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August nineteen eighteen\n\nOld wire crosses the withdrawal route. A pioneer crouches to move the broken strands. Canadian troops have passed the forward works, and guns still fire beside the village. Shellfire exposes abandoned ammunition, leaving a pointed shell in the chalk.\n\nBearers meet reliefs at a field boundary while wounded men pass between them. The NCO lets a stretcher through first, then directs the others along the ditch. A gunner turns to find his bearer, but vehicles have blocked the junction behind the position.\n\nAllied attacks drove the Germans back during the Hundred Days."),TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 一九一八年八月下旬\n\n旧铁丝横在撤回路上，工兵蹲下把断股搬开。加拿大部队已穿过前方阵位，村边的枪组还在射击。炮火又翻出遗弃弹药，白垩土里露着一枚弹尖。\n\n携弹队与换防人员在田界碰面，伤员从窄路中间送走。军士先让担架过去，再叫后面的人沿沟走。枪手回头找自己的携弹兵，路口已被车辆堵住。\n\n协约国在百日攻势中持续迫使德军后撤。")},
    {TEXT("de.hindenburg"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen\n\nLoose earth covers the towpath carrying ammunition to the guns above. Smoke hides the opposite slope as British troops approach the canal. Pioneers examine the damaged bank route. A gunner bends over his position to watch the water below.\n\nReserves wait behind the posts. Returning reliefs report a break in the path. The NCO has two men lift a box and take it towards the slope instead. The guns continue firing, but the runner at the far end of the towpath is gone.\n\nBritish troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on twenty-nine September."),TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日\n\n纤道上落满碎土，送弹队要从这里到达岸上枪位。烟把对面坡脚遮住，英军正在接近运河。工兵沿受损岸路查看，枪手俯身从高处寻找水边的动静。\n\n预备队在前哨后等候，换防人员带回道路被打断的消息。军士让两个人抬起一只弹箱，改从斜坡接近。枪声没有停，纤道尽头却已看不到联络兵。\n\n英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。")},
    {TEXT("de.selle"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October nineteen eighteen\n\nLoading continues at the station. The train in the cutting fires towards the valley entrance as troops withdraw along the road. Shells fall beyond the embankment. Riflemen covering the approach turn to see bearers coming from the station.\n\nReliefs enter along the riverbank. The NCO explains the approach to a new gunner. The embankment hides the train's side, leaving its upper guns visible. More loading can be heard behind them. The stretcher party waits for the vehicles ahead to move out.\n\nThe Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen."),TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月\n\n车站还在装运，切口里的列车向谷口开火。公路上有部队撤过来，炮弹落在路堤另一面。守着接近路的步枪手回头，看见携弹兵正从车站跑来。\n\n换防队沿河岸进入阵地，军士把来路交代给新枪手。路堤遮住列车侧面，只露出上面的枪位。车站方向又响起装车声，担架队等着前面的车辆先走。\n\n塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。")},
    {TEXT("de.valenciennes1918"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November nineteen eighteen\n\nA civilian handcart passes the gun, its wheels jolting over broken bricks. Canadian troops approach the outskirts while the rearguard holds the exit. Reliefs come through the orchard and other parties withdraw beyond the ruined walls.\n\nWounded men and military vehicles fill the road. The NCO keeps signalling those ahead to move. Riflemen wait in a shallow ditch, hearing shots beyond the wall. The handcart catches on a brick beside them; a passing man reaches over to steady its loaded frame.\n\nCanadian troops took Valenciennes in early November."),TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 一九一八年十一月初\n\n枪组身旁经过一辆平民手推车，车轮在碎砖上颠簸。加拿大部队正向外围逼近，后卫还守着出口。换防人员沿果园过来，其他部队从残墙后退向城外。\n\n路上挤着伤员和军车，军士不断示意前面继续走。步枪手伏在浅沟里等候，墙另一侧有射击声。手推车卡在一块砖上，旁边的人伸手扶了一把。\n\n加拿大部队于十一月初攻占瓦朗谢讷。")},
    {TEXT("de.sambre"),TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen\n\nThe rearguard gun faces the canal crossing. Reserves wait at the junction for men still forward. News of armistices elsewhere has arrived with today's withdrawal orders. Civilians push their belongings between the returning columns on the outskirts road.\n\nSome men remain at the outposts. Bearers put their last boxes under a wall. The NCO watches the approach and signals another party through the damaged obstacles. The gunner holds the warm grips. Rifle fire sounds again from the bank beyond the crossing.\n\nThe Western Front armistice took effect at eleven on eleven November."),TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日\n\n后卫机枪朝着运河渡口，预备队留在路口等人。别处停战的消息到了，今天的撤离命令也到了。城郊公路上，居民推着家当夹在撤回的纵队之间。\n\n前哨还有人员没有回来，携弹兵把剩余箱子放在墙下。军士望着来路，示意最后一队先通过障碍。枪手握住已经发热的握把，河岸那边又传来步枪声。\n\n十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。")},
    {TEXT("fr.mort_homme"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Le Mort-Homme · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe relief comes from behind the wood and finds empty boxes beside the Hotchkiss crew. Shellfire continues along the ridge. Lebel riflemen lie at the neighbouring approach. The NCO explains the route, pausing when a near burst drowns his voice.\n\nBearers arrive through the trench behind the slope and put their boxes beside the mounting. Trees hide the next post. A raised hand tells the men to stay low. The new gunner wipes mud from the loophole and takes his predecessor's place.\n\nGerman attacks extended to the Meuse's west bank in March."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 勒莫尔奥姆 · 一九一六年三月\n\n换防队从林后上来，先看见哈奇开斯枪组身旁的空弹箱。山脊上的炮击还没有停，勒贝尔步枪手伏在相邻入口。军士交代去路，声音被近处爆炸打断。\n\n携弹手沿坡后的交通壕赶到，把箱子放在枪架旁。树木挡着邻哨，前面的人抬手示意继续伏低。新到的枪手擦去射孔边的泥，接过了上一班的位置。\n\n德军在三月把凡尔登进攻扩展到默兹河西岸。")},
    {TEXT("fr.vaux"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Outside Fort Vaux · June nineteen sixteen\n\nThe runner holds his report but cannot cross the open ground at the village entrance. German troops press the fort's outer positions. French guns still fire between ruined walls. The relief waits below the masonry for a passage forward.\n\nA machine gun turns towards a gap in the ruins. Riflemen spread along the wall. The NCO keeps the runner close and looks towards the opposite trench mouth. The fort lies farther away; fragments already cover the short village road before them.\n\nFort Vaux fell to German troops in June."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 沃堡外围 · 一九一六年六月\n\n战报攥在联络兵手里，村口的空地却过不去。德军已压近堡垒外围，残墙之间仍有法军枪位射击。换防队伏在墙下，等前沿的人指出一条通路。\n\n机枪转向废墟缺口，步枪手沿墙根分开。军士让联络兵留在近处，自己探头观察对面的壕口。堡垒还在更远的地方，眼前一段村道已经落满弹屑。\n\n沃堡在六月落入德军之手。")},
    {TEXT("fr.douaumont"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Outside Douaumont · Twenty-four October nineteen sixteen\n\nThe guns lift over the slope below the fort and the counteroffensive opens. German troops have held Douaumont since February. Wire crosses the uphill approaches. The leading men lie in shell holes while the sappers bring their cutters to the trench mouth.\n\nThe crest hides the guns behind it. Bearers follow the crater banks. Orders pass down both approaches. A telephone wire drags through water; the linesman kneels in the mud. Headquarters waits for the first answer from the heights.\n\nFrench forces recovered Fort Douaumont in this counteroffensive."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 杜奥蒙外围 · 一九一六年十月二十四日\n\n炮火越过堡垒下方的坡面，反攻开始。德军自二月占着杜奥蒙，铁丝横在上坡路上。先头队伏于弹坑，等工兵把剪钳送到壕口。\n\n坡脊挡住了后面的枪位。携弹手贴着坑岸前送，军士沿两条接近路传下出发口令。电话线拖过积水，接线兵跪在泥里；连部等着第一声来自高处的回话。\n\n法军在这次反攻中收复杜奥蒙堡垒。")},
    {TEXT("fr.louvemont"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Louvemont · December nineteen sixteen\n\nBoots pull free of the mud with a sharp sound. The leading men wait beside the village road. The French advance north of Verdun has resumed, but trees and an embankment hide the next section. Men leaving the road sink deeper.\n\nWire crosses the slope. Bearers squeeze through a surviving gap as firing starts beyond the ridge. The NCO lies beside the track to observe. Men press against the wall for a passing stretcher; mud drips from its occupant's coat onto the stones.\n\nThe Battle of Verdun lasted about three hundred days."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 卢沃蒙 · 一九一六年十二月\n\n鞋拔出泥时带起一声响，前队停在村道旁等候。法军又向凡尔登北面进攻，路堤与树林挡住邻班。离开路面的士兵陷得更深，只能扶着彼此回到硬地。\n\n铁丝横过坡面，携弹队从残留缺口挤进来。枪声在脊后响起，军士伏到路边观察。担架送过时众人贴住墙根，湿泥从伤员的衣角滴在石头上。\n\n凡尔登战役持续约三百日。")},
    {TEXT("fr.chemin_dames"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Chemin des Dames · Sixteen April nineteen seventeen\n\nThe first trench shows on the slope, but machine guns still fire from behind the crest. The Nivelle offensive has begun. Men wait below the wire while shelled earth slips beside their boots. A bomber watches a loophole higher up.\n\nThe NCO passes orders between the shell holes. A bearer drags his box to the trench mouth. When the nearer gun stops, another opens behind it. A rifleman holds down a companion starting to rise. More earth falls from the crest.\n\nWidespread mutinies followed the failed Chemin des Dames offensive."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贵妇小径 · 一九一七年四月十六日\n\n第一道壕沟露在坡上，脊后却还有机枪开火。尼韦尔攻势已经开始，前队伏在铁丝前等候。炮击过的土在靴边滑下，投弹兵盯着更高处的射孔。\n\n军士从弹坑间逐人传话，携弹手把箱子拖到壕口。较近枪位一停，后面又响起射击声。步枪手伸手扶住要起身的同伴，坡顶的土又被打了下来。\n\n贵妇小径进攻失败后，法军爆发大规模抗命。")},
    {TEXT("fr.malmaison"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · La Malmaison · Twenty-three October nineteen seventeen\n\nHeavy shells have filled the communication trench with loose earth. Sappers walk beside the infantry towards this stretch of the Chemin des Dames. Broken stakes still hold wire on the slope. The NCO checks the leading party at each traverse.\n\nThe guns lift farther away. A crew brings its equipment to the bend. Men try to see beyond the ridge, but the parapet blocks their view. A sapper crawls towards the wire; those behind leave space for a stretcher to pass.\n\nFrench forces captured the La Malmaison sector in October."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 拉马尔梅松 · 一九一七年十月二十三日\n\n重炮轰过的交通壕里满是碎土，工兵走在步兵旁边。进攻队来到贵妇小径的这段高地，坡上的铁丝还挂着断桩。军士沿壕角核对前队的位置。\n\n炮声向远处移去，枪组把器材送到转弯处。先头队试着看清脊后，视线却被胸墙挡住。工兵放下工具，伏着向铁丝接近，后面的人留下了够一副担架通过的空隙。\n\n法军在十月攻占拉马尔梅松一带。")},
    {TEXT("fr.matz"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Belloy Approaches · Eleven June nineteen eighteen\n\nGuns sound beyond the hedge as French troops on the heights counterattack the German flank. Men still pass along the valley road. A crew faces its mounting towards the trees. Riflemen watch from the field edges, losing sight of each other across the plots.\n\nBearers arrive from the assembly ground and ask where the leading party went. The NCO points uphill, then turns the remaining men towards the wood. A vehicle stops behind the hedge. Men beside the road lie in the ditch.\n\nFrench forces counterattacked the German flank at the Matz on eleven June."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 贝卢瓦接近路 · 一九一八年六月十一日\n\n树篱外响起炮声，高地上的法军开始向德军侧翼反击。谷地公路还有部队通过，枪组把枪架朝林缘摆正。步枪手贴着田边观察，隔一块地便看不见彼此。\n\n携弹队从后侧集合地赶来，在路口问前队去了哪里。军士伸手指向坡上，又叫留下的人转向树林。一辆车在树篱后停下，路边的人伏进浅沟。\n\n六月十一日，法军反击马茨地区的德军侧翼。")},
    {TEXT("fr.champagne_defence"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Champagne · Fifteen July nineteen eighteen\n\nMen returning from the outposts enter the trench with news of the German attack. Gouraud's Fourth Army holds positions in depth, with the main line farther behind. Slopes separate the guns across the fields. Reports overlap on the telephone.\n\nTwo communication trenches lead back. A bearer stands aside at a traverse. The NCO checks the returning men and sends a runner towards the next post. Bullets cross the ground outside. The messenger lowers his cap and starts forward along the trench again.\n\nThe German July attack failed to break through in Champagne."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 香槟 · 一九一八年七月十五日\n\n前哨回来的人从壕口钻入，带来德军进攻的消息。古罗的第四集团军守着纵深阵地，主防线还在后面。田野上的枪位被坡地隔开，电话里同时有人报告。\n\n两条交通壕通向后方，携弹手站在转角让出路。军士查过回来的人，再派联络兵去找邻哨。沟外地面被枪弹扫过，报信的人把帽子压低，重新向前走。\n\n德军七月进攻未能突破香槟防线。")},
    {TEXT("fr.soissons"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · Soissons Sector · Eighteen July nineteen eighteen\n\nMen waiting to move fill the forest fork. Guns can be heard beyond the trees as the counterattack turns towards the German salient's western flank. The leading party reaches the edge. Wire crosses the field, covered by a trench beside the village.\n\nMore men arrive from the Villers-Cotterêts direction. The NCO directs sections along two paths. A bearer checks his box lid and follows the first men out of the shade. They drop in the field, leaving a space at the forest exit.\n\nThe Allied Marne counteroffensive began on eighteen July."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 苏瓦松方向 · 一九一八年七月十八日\n\n林间岔路挤着等候出发的人，树下听得见外面的炮声。反攻指向德军马恩突出部西翼，先头队已到林缘。铁丝横在开阔地上，村边侧壕朝这里射击。\n\n后续人员从维莱科特雷方向赶来，军士把各班引向两条小路。携弹手摸过箱盖，跟着前队跨出树影。刚到田地的人伏了下去，林口又空出一段路。\n\n七月十八日，协约国发起马恩反攻。")},
    {TEXT("fr.sommepy"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF MARCHES AND OPERATIONS · South of Somme-Py · Twenty-six September nineteen eighteen\n\nOld wire crosses the fields as the barrage moves onto deeper positions. Fourth Army advances towards Somme-Py. Riflemen search for a gap from the southern slope. There is little cover ahead; a crew lifts its equipment, then lies down again.\n\nMen move through a rear trench towards the German front. A loophole on the flank also fires. The NCO passes orders along the ditch. A bearer pushes his box to the leading men. A sapper reaches under the wire with cutters.\n\nAllied attacks opened in Champagne and the Argonne on twenty-six September."),TEXT("行军作战日志 · 索姆皮南侧 · 一九一八年九月二十六日\n\n老铁丝横过田野，炮火已经转向更深的阵地。第四集团军向索姆皮方向进攻，步枪手在南坡寻找缺口。坡前少有遮蔽，枪组刚抬起器材便又伏下。\n\n后壕里有人向德军前沿移动，侧面的射孔也在开火。军士沿沟传下口令，携弹手把弹箱推到前队脚旁。工兵在铁丝下伸进剪钳，断丝落在湿土上。\n\n九月二十六日，协约国在香槟与阿尔贡发动进攻。")},
    {TEXT("ru.galicia"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gnila Lipa · August nineteen fourteen\n\nMen halt at the bridgehead while the Maxim crew waits behind to cross. An Austro-Hungarian gun fires from the opposite bank, partly hidden by trees. Engineers crouch beside the bridge. Riflemen search along the embankment for another approach.\n\nBoxes and equipment pass one at a time through the narrow space. Following troops gather under the trees. The NCO gives the order of passage at the bridge mouth. A man ahead raises his hand, and the crew pushes its wheeled mounting another step.\n\nRussian forces occupied much of Galicia in nineteen fourteen."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 格尼拉利帕河 · 一九一四年八月\n\n桥头有人停下，马克沁枪组还在后面等着过桥。对岸的奥匈枪位朝渡口射击，林木遮住了河岸。工兵沿桥边伏低，步枪手从路堤旁寻找另一条接近路。\n\n弹箱和器材在窄处逐件送来，后续队伍挤在树下。军士走到桥口交代次序，前队的人抬手回应。水面映着断枝，枪组把轮架往前推了一步。\n\n俄军在一九一四年占领加利西亚大片地区。")},
    {TEXT("ru.przemysl"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Przemyśl · March nineteen fifteen\n\nA sentry signals from the tree line. The gun turns towards the low pass. The siege has cut the fortress's supply routes, but its defenders may still come out through the woods. Russian posts spread along the ridge with only short views between them.\n\nThe NCO sends a runner around to the next post. Bearers wait behind the crest. Shots sound among the trees and riflemen press against the bank. Glasses search the gaps between trunks. The messenger has not returned.\n\nPrzemyśl surrendered to Russian forces in March nineteen fifteen."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 普热梅希尔外围 · 一九一五年三月\n\n林口的哨兵举手示意，枪组把枪口转向低隘。要塞的补给已被围困切断，守军仍可能从树林出击。俄军警戒队沿山脊展开，前后的人只能看见最近一段路。\n\n军士派联络兵绕到邻哨，携弹手留在山脊背后等候。林间响起射击声，步枪手贴住土坡。望远镜扫过树干之间的空隙，没有看见送信的人回来。\n\n普热梅希尔于一九一五年三月向俄军投降。")},
    {TEXT("ru.gorlice"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Gorlice Sector · Two May nineteen fifteen\n\nBranches fall overhead as shells cover the pass before the ridge. German and Austro-Hungarian troops are attacking. Men begin leaving the assembly ground below the wood. The gun crew stays on the crest while a bearer drags boxes into the shallow trench.\n\nThe NCO hears the outpost report and places riflemen at the forest path. The column below has not all gone. Men turn back for wounded comrades. Enemy infantry appear on the nearer slope, and the mounting is pushed towards the parapet.\n\nThe Gorlice breakthrough forced a Russian retreat from Galicia."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 戈尔利采方向 · 一九一五年五月二日\n\n树枝从头顶落下，山脊前面的隘口已被炮火覆盖。德军与奥匈军正在进攻，林下集合地开始撤离。枪组留在脊线上，携弹手把箱子拖进浅壕。\n\n军士听过前哨报告，让步枪手守住林道入口。山下的队伍还没有全部走完，路上有人转身回来接伤员。敌军步兵在近坡露出身影，枪架被推向壕肩。\n\n戈尔利采突破迫使俄军从加利西亚后撤。")},
    {TEXT("ru.warsaw_rearguard"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · East of Warsaw · August nineteen fifteen\n\nTroops leaving the city crowd the crossing's exit. The bridgehead gun still fires westwards. A railway cutting narrows the route, and bearers move beside the returning column. Reports from the posts grow shorter as German troops approach the entrance.\n\nThe NCO keeps the rearguard by the embankment and lets parties pass in turn. A wounded man sits on a box, waiting for a stretcher. Riflemen watch the trees on the flank. Wheels sound on the bridge, pressing men closer against the bank.\n\nRussian armies withdrew from Poland in the summer of nineteen fifteen."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 华沙以东 · 一九一五年八月\n\n渡口出口挤满撤出城市的部队，桥头枪组仍朝西面射击。铁路切口把退路压成窄道，携弹队从人群旁边靠近。前哨传来的消息越来越短，德军已逼近入口。\n\n军士把后卫留在路堤边，让返回的人逐队经过。伤员坐在弹箱上等担架，步枪手向侧面树林张望。桥上传来车轮声，岸边的人又往壕壁贴紧一些。\n\n俄军在一九一五年夏撤出波兰。")},
    {TEXT("ru.naroch"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Lake Naroch · March nineteen sixteen\n\nThe gun crew stops before the narrow causeway. Muddy water surrounds its wheels. German wire blocks the exit, and enemy guns cover the approach. Riflemen watch it from the trees. More men arrive behind them, but the leading party cannot spread to either side.\n\nThe NCO passes orders along the embankment. Bearers set their boxes at the end of the firm ground. One man steps into the marsh and is pulled back. Shots come from behind the wire. The gunner waits beneath the mounting.\n\nThe Naroch offensive failed to break the German line."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 纳罗奇湖 · 一九一六年三月\n\n枪组在窄堤前停住，轮架旁边尽是泥水。德军铁丝横在堤道出口，步枪手从林缘观察那条受火力监视的路。后面的人已经赶到，前队却无法向两侧散开。\n\n军士沿路堤传下口令，携弹手把箱子放在硬地尽头。有人试着踏进沼地，随即被同伴拉回。射击声从铁丝后传来，枪手伏到轮架下面等候。\n\n纳罗奇攻势未能突破德军防线。")},
    {TEXT("ru.lutsk"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Lutsk · Four June nineteen sixteen\n\nThe guns sound beyond the head of the approach trench. The Southwestern Front has begun its attack. Austro-Hungarian wire is already visible, with a trench leading to each of the two gaps. The platoon commander gives the order of departure at the traverse.\n\nA deeper trench lies behind the first works; the fields between are bare. The leading men keep their muzzles low. Bearers pass boxes over the water. Stretcher parties wait in the approach trench as the remaining sections answer the roll again.\n\nBrusilov's offensive broke the Austro-Hungarian defences around Lutsk."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 卢茨克 · 一九一六年六月四日\n\n接近壕尽头传来炮声，西南方面军开始进攻。奥匈军的铁丝已经看得清楚，两处缺口各有一条壕道相通。排长在壕角交代出发次序。\n\n第一道工事后面还有深壕，田野无遮无挡。前队压低枪口等待，携弹手把箱子递过泥水。担架队留在接近壕内，点名的人把尚未出发的各班又查了一遍。\n\n布鲁西洛夫攻势突破了奥匈军在卢茨克一带的防御。")},
    {TEXT("ru.czernowitz"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Czernowitz · June nineteen sixteen\n\nThe leading party reaches the trees after crossing the river. Firing has begun at the village junction. The Brusilov offensive has reached Bukovina, where Austro-Hungarian troops still contest the streets. An armoured train approaches along rails hidden by houses.\n\nRiflemen search for the next party below a wall. Bearers cross the junction with their boxes. The NCO listens to the wheels, then points towards the open ground beyond the trees. A length of carriage appears, and the crew moves its equipment beside a doorway.\n\nBrusilov's offensive inflicted severe losses on the Austro-Hungarian army."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 切尔诺维茨 · 一九一六年六月\n\n渡河后先头队来到林边，村道交叉口已经响起枪声。布鲁西洛夫攻势推进到布科维纳，奥匈部队还在争夺街巷。装甲列车从铁路驶来，房屋挡住了前面的路。\n\n步枪手在墙下寻找邻队，携弹兵带着箱子穿过路口。军士抬头听了一下车轮声，再指向林外空地。列车露出一截车身，枪组把器材搬到门旁。\n\n布鲁西洛夫攻势重创了奥匈军队。")},
    {TEXT("ru.kovel"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Stokhod River · July nineteen sixteen\n\nMen line the railway embankment, but a machine gun fires beyond the short bridge. Wet ground covers the approaches towards Kovel. Wire bars the riverbank. Riflemen lie beside the narrow path, waiting for the crew to bring its equipment forward.\n\nGerman reinforcements have reached the sector, and firing thickens at the bridgehead. The NCO watches the river while a runner returns beside the marsh. Following troops crowd the embankment. A bearer holds his box against his chest to let a stretcher through.\n\nThe Russian advance towards Kovel was halted on the Stokhod."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 斯托霍德河 · 一九一六年七月\n\n铁路路堤上排着前进的队伍，短桥对岸却有机枪开火。通往科韦利的接近地一片潮湿，铁丝挡在河岸前。步枪手伏在窄路旁，等后面的枪组把器材送来。\n\n德军增援已经到达这一带，桥头的枪声更密了。军士向河边观察，传令兵从沼泽旁返回。后续人员又挤上路堤，携弹手把箱子抱在胸前给担架让路。\n\n俄军向科韦利的推进受阻于斯托霍德河。")},
    {TEXT("ru.kerensky"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Eastern Galicia · July nineteen seventeen\n\nThe Provisional Government's attack orders have arrived. Men assemble at the edge of the wood. Ridges divide the Austro-Hungarian positions; a muzzle shows on the near slope, but the ground behind is hidden. The platoon commander gives each section its direction.\n\nBearers wait beside the approach while a runner finds them through the trees. News from the neighbouring party breaks off under the guns. A rifleman keeps his bayonet clear of the branches and waits for the commander to raise his hand again.\n\nThe Russian summer offensive of nineteen seventeen ended in failure."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 东加利西亚 · 一九一七年七月\n\n临时政府的进攻命令已经传下，前队在林地边缘集合。山脊把奥匈阵地分成几段，近坡上有枪口，脊后却看不清。排长沿着树根走过去，逐班交代出发方向。\n\n携弹手等在接近路旁，联络兵从林间找来。相邻队伍的消息只传到一半，炮声又盖过人声。前排步枪手把刺刀避开树枝，等排长再次举手。\n\n俄军一九一七年的夏季攻势终告失败。")},
    {TEXT("ru.riga"),TEXT("JOURNAL OF OPERATIONS · Outside Riga · September nineteen seventeen\n\nThe bridgehead beside the railway bank remains open. Withdrawing troops emerge from the wood. German forces have crossed the Daugava and are approaching the routes out, while firing draws nearer along the river. The crew waits beside the bridge for the outpost men.\n\nThe NCO checks the passing column. A bearer puts his box beneath the mounting. Someone calls from the tree line and riflemen turn towards the gap. Men on the bridge quicken their steps, their boots striking the planks in succession.\n\nGerman troops occupied Riga in September nineteen seventeen."),TEXT("军事行动日志 · 里加外围 · 一九一七年九月\n\n铁路路堤旁的桥头还在通行，撤下来的部队从树林里走出。德军渡过道加瓦河后正向退路逼近，河岸枪声越来越近。枪组守在桥边，等前哨的人回来。\n\n军士沿路检查队伍，携弹手把弹箱放到枪架下。有人在林口喊了一声，步枪手转向树间的空隙。桥上的人加快脚步，木板被靴子踩得接连作响。\n\n德军在一九一七年九月占领里加。")},
};
